            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Séance 0.2.10 — over-the-air update test

Version-only release to test updating from Mac 0.2.9 and iPhone 0.2.9 (52).
The app functionality is unchanged. Existing projects, chats and pairing should
remain available after updating.

Mac: use Séance → Check for Updates, then install through the native updater.
iPhone: open Séance Settings, check for updates, open the offered installer in
Safari, confirm installation, and reopen Séance. The installed version should
be 0.2.10 (53).
]]></description>
